#: src/concurrency/async-control-flow/select.md:49
msgid ""
"`select!` is also frequently used in a loop in \"actor\" architectures, "
"where a task reacts to events in a loop. That has some pitfalls, which will "
"be discussed in the next segment."
msgstr ""
